{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46087","headline":"蜀王登福感寺塔三首 三 · 贯休","name":"蜀王登福感寺塔三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"步步层层孰可陪，相轮边日照三台。\n喜欢烝庶皆相逐，惆怅銮舆尚未回。\n金铎撼风天乐近，仙花含露瑞烟开。\n一年一度常如此，愿见文翁百度来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46087.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46087","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}